# Generated / build output and logs: keep them out of Cursor's index and context.
# Note: convex/ is NOT ignored. The Convex runtime is retired, but convex/lib is
# still imported by supabase/functions/_shared, the web/mobile builds and the tests.
mobile/.expo-check-bundle/
.azure-logs/
web/assets/
web/dist/
convex/_generated/
convex-export-tmp
convex-export-tmp/
web/babitk-local-seed.json
web/public/babitk-local-seed.json
.tmp-*
**/*.log
